        "ja": "アップリュー",
        "ko": "애프룡",
        "ja-Hrkt": "アップリュー",
        "zh-Hans": "苹裹龙",
        "zh-Hant": "蘋裹龍"
      },
      "description": {
        "fun": "Applin's tart-apple evolution flies on wings of apple skin and spits an acid, stored in its cheeks, strong enough to melt metal. Fold the wings and it passes for an apple again. Its flying-apple theme and its signature move, Grav Apple, may tip a hat to the famous tale of a falling apple inspiring the theory of gravity.",
        "guide": "The evolution of Applin given a Tart Apple, a small Grass and Dragon Pokémon that flies on apple-skin wings and spits a metal-melting acid. It can fold up to look like an apple. It has a Gigantamax form.",
        "tagline": "A tiny dragon flying on wings of apple skin",
        "sources": [
          {
            "title": "Bulbapedia: Flapple (Pokémon)",
            "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Flapple_(Pok%C3%A9mon)"
          }
        ]
      },
