        "ja-Hrkt": "タルップル",
        "zh-Hans": "丰蜜龙",
        "zh-Hant": "豐蜜龍"
      },
      "description": {
        "fun": "Applin's sweet-apple evolution has a back like an apple pie, and the skin there is said to be so tasty that children used to eat it as a snack. The nectar coating its body lures in the bug Pokémon it eats, and when Lechonk come to lick it off, Appletun drives them away with sprays of sticky nectar.",
        "guide": "The evolution of Applin given a Sweet Apple, a bulky Grass and Dragon Pokémon covered in sweet nectar that lures in bug Pokémon. The skin on its back resembles apple pie. It has a Gigantamax form.",
        "tagline": "A sleepy dragon with an apple pie for a back",
        "sources": [
          {
            "title": "Bulbapedia: Appletun (Pokémon)",
            "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Appletun_(Pok%C3%A9mon)"
