        "zh-Hans": "裹蜜虫",
        "zh-Hant": "裹蜜蟲"
      },
      "description": {
        "fun": "Two dragons in one candy apple: the head poking out belongs to the fore-wyrm and the tail to the core-wyrm, and the pair share their apple and help each other out. Its evolution comes from the Syrupy Apple, grown only in Kitakami, and together they coat their home in layers of fragrant syrup.",
        "guide": "The evolution of Applin given a Syrupy Apple, introduced in The Teal Mask for Pokémon Scarlet and Violet. Dipplin is two creatures living in one syrup-coated apple, and it evolves into Hydrapple.",
        "tagline": "Two little wyrms sharing one candy apple",
        "sources": [
          {
            "title": "Bulbapedia: Dipplin (Pokémon)",
            "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Dipplin_(Pok%C3%A9mon)"
